<title>JAPAN: Chuo Trust says disposed of Y116 bln problem loans.</title>
<headline>Chuo Trust says disposed of Y116 bln problem loans.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chuo Trust &amp; Banking Co Ltd said on Monday it disposed of an estimated 116 billion yen of problem loans in fiscal 1996/97, ended March 31.</p>
<p>It also said it posted a 46.58 billion yen appraisal loss on securities holdings, mainly due to stock price declines.</p>
<p>The bank is scheduled to announce its 1996/97 business results in late May.</p>
</text>
